Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:14:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Cochilo joins the system (0.4.0)

A cochilo layer (Compose, light + dark) with every core token, uikit's
type roles and sizes, the panel and snackbar colours, and six event data
hues for the timeline. Generator for CTokens.kt and cochilo.css, drift.py
--cochilo, the CO_ mark and three icons (chart, moon, sun). Divergence
D-11: night viewing. Audit: audits/2026-11-01-v0.4.0-cochilo.md.
